D Radiation energy density (erg cm^-3) in the LW band, sinks + background (KROME chi_FUV and dust heating)
VARIABLE ULWD

D Radiation energy density (erg cm^-3) in the PE band, sinks + background (KROME chi_FUV and dust heating)
VARIABLE UPED

