VARIABLE UVF0

D Variable storing the shielded dissociation rate of H2
VARIABLE DIH2

D Variable storing the shielded ionization rate of Carbon
VARIABLE IC

D Variable storing the shielded dissociation rate of CO
VARIABLE DICO

